# 默认按文本处理，diff 友好
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 明确标记为二进制，避免 Git 当成文本做 diff ----
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.dxf   binary
*.mp4   binary

# ---- 让 GitHub 语言统计正确识别 ----
*.html linguist-detectable=true
*.css  linguist-detectable=true
*.js   linguist-detectable=true
